# Pauses and timing
@scenario tutorial_lesson_02
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide curious]
pip: A wait pauses the script. Listen for the short gap before the sound plays.
[wait 320]
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
pip: Change the wait from 320 to 800 milliseconds, then listen again.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: Which change delays the chime without slowing the words?
> Lower the text speed. -> retry
> Increase the wait before the sound. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: A wait holds the scene. Text speed controls how the current line appears. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: A wait holds the scene. Text speed controls how the current line appears.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_02]
[flag tutorial_done_02]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
